# Paths left out of the Mainuan image and kept out by dpkg path-exclude
# (/etc/dpkg/dpkg.cfg.d/mainuan-exclude-paths). One path per line.
# /usr/share/plasma/desktoptheme/default must never be listed: it is the
# Breeze Plasma style and the fallback of every other Plasma style.

